  "f55e2b5259": "■Time Survival\n　The battlefield is a chaotic dimension made by a Shocker\n　Researcher's experiment. Clear several missions in the\n　time limit to earn special figures.\n\n■Time Limit and Time Bonus\n　You fail if the level's time limit runs out. Clear bonuses\n　and time bonuses for meeting objectives extend it.\n\n■Restrictions\n　Missions have restrictions that put you at a disadvantage.\n　If a mission is too hard, change your figures or\n　level up your character.",
  "e16d841220": "Time Survival Level 1 cleared!\n\nIf you find a Shocker Researcher in Story Mode, defeat him before he escapes to unlock Time Survival.",
  "f5bfaaf4fa": "Time Survival Level 2 cleared!\n\nYou earn Rider Souls based on the time left when you clear a level, so try to clear levels as fast as you can.",
  "4b119dbad5": "Time Survival Level 3 cleared!\n\nOnce you're used to fighting, meet objectives to add time, and earn more Rider Souls when you clear the level.",
  "742acd63fc": "Time Survival Level 4 cleared!\n\nYou don't always have to defeat every enemy.\nSometimes it's better to ride your bike to the goal.",
  "86d0c7e1d5": "Time Survival Level 5 cleared!\n\nEquip figures with skills that offset the restrictions, or choose a tag partner with a voltage bonus.",
  "b5760af3c2": "Time Survival Level 6 cleared!\n\nFighting together with your tag partner is key to beating enemies fast. Make good use of requests and mode changes.",
  "695a5cb47d": "Time Survival Level 7 cleared!\n\nClear the final mission of Level 7 and the final mission of Story Mode to earn a special figure.",
  "be5e8fc7f6": "Rider War (WIP)",
